"veličine na OpenMV 3 (\\ :ref:`promjena compress <v2_1_0_compress>`\\ ); "
"ponovno podesite zoom ``lens_corr()`` (\\ :ref:`promjena lens_corr "
"<v2_1_0_lenscorr>`\\ )."

